{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52340","headline":"诗（幷序） 一○一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 一○一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"父子相怜爱，千金不肯博。\n忽死贱如泥，遥看畏近着。\n东家朾（项疑「钉」）桃符，西家县赤索。\n藂（张改作「聚」）头唱奈何，相催早埋却。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}